# No comments

On every coding change, read and follow `.cursor/skills/no-comments/SKILL.md` (same content as `C:\Users\fanel\Downloads\SKILL.md`). This is mandatory, not optional.

- Do not add comments, section banners, or narrative docstrings in new or changed code.
- After edits are in the working tree, run that skill before finishing: spawn `Task` with `subagent_type: "Comment Sicko"` on the changed files, then act on accepted findings.
- If Comment Sicko is not an available subagent, apply the skill yourself on the same diff: delete unjustified comments; keep only proven exceptions.
